 			<p>“Ay! ay! ay!” replied three voices at once.</p>
 			<p>“Good! Bless you! Now, as there’s nothing like ‘taking time by the <em>fetlock</em>,’ as Winkle characteristically observes, allow me to present the new member;” and, to the dismay of the rest of the club, Jo threw open the door of the closet, and displayed Laurie sitting on a ragbag, flushed and twinkling with suppressed laughter.</p>
 			<p>“You rogue! you traitor! Jo, how could you?” cried the three girls, as Snodgrass led her friend triumphantly forth; and, producing both a chair and a badge, installed him in a jiffy.</p>
